      "side": 1,
      "message": "Seems find_mem_range() only checks for a single memory, so introduced an inline function is_mem_range() to check for the entire memory range in aosp/3783087, and add this check for host sharing/unsharing hyp in hyp_ack_share/unshare in aosp/3783087. The reason not doing this in host_request_share/unshare is considering host may allow to share MMIO page with an npVM in the future, putting the check in host_request_share/unshare will block this usage.\n\nMeanwhile, with this consideration, the host_initiate_share/unshare also cannot blindly pin/unpin memory pages, so also added the is_mem_range() check in host_initiate_share/unshare before pin/unpin.",
